// IntroString :
"P3388604577" "If you want to stay in the Rogue Isles, {VillainName}, there's one thing you need to learn right away: Arachnos can be your ally, or your enemy. Support us, serve us, and we will reward you. Stab us in the back, and it will be the last move you make. <br><br>There is an operative here on Mercy who used to be our ally, but he has recently made himself our enemy. Operative Burch. As we speak, the fool is planning to sell confidential Arachnos information to those troublesome do-gooders, Longbow. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to take him out.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2452232809" "Take out Operative Burch"
// SendOffString :
"P2669394408" "You've heard of Longbow, I expect? A group of trained soldiers and superhumans out to make everyone in the world do things their way? Their leader, Ms. Liberty, seems to think it's her place to meddle in Arachnos affairs. She's sorely mistaken, I assure you. <br><br>Burch plans to meet Longbow at the docks. We'll have a boat take you there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3801894679" "Defeat Burch & all negotiators"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P304808797" "Someone is going to pay for Burch's treachery. If you don't bring him back here, it could be you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2169928571" "You don't know Operative Burch from Adam, but you know bringing him in will make you look good to Kalinda."

